changelog: startTbl;
  1:"ADDITION|Added the Flame glove.";
  2:"ADDITION|Added rifts that can spawn around the map.";
  3:"ADDITION|Added some UI enhancements.";
  4:"ADDITION|Added a passive ability (plague) to Infector.";
  5:"ADDITION|Added 4 new settings options: Self Music Volume, Self Music Rolloff Distance, Other Music Volume, and Other Music Rolloff Distance.";
  6:"ADDITION|Added full VR support.";
  7:"ADDITION|Added The Backrooms.";
  8:"ADDITION|Added an ability to Default.";
  9:"ADDITION|Added a menu to view all available abilities.";
  10:"ADDITION|Added a global announcement system. (finally)";
  11:"ADDITION|Added a blur to the streak effect for 100 and 120.";
  12:"ADDITION|Added a screen effect to Killstreak Classic 325.";
  13:"ADDITION|Added 500 Killstreak Classic and Killstreak Revengeance.";
  14:"ADDITION|Added some more signs in the lobby to make stuff more obvious.";
  15:"ADDITION|Expanded the lobby.";
  16:"ADDITION|Added Slapple Island.";
  17:"CHANGE|Changed the price of Temporal from 750 to 500.";
  18:"CHANGE|Your health now increases as you get more kills to account for the passive abilities of Infector and Flame. (+10/9 HP every kill after 10 kills)";
  19:"CHANGE|Merged Revelation Engine and Massive Engine as all systems from ME have been moved over to RE.";
  20:"CHANGE|The size of the UI sidebar buttons now decrease if too many buttons are enabled. (this really only affects devs)";
  21:"CHANGE|The volume of Streak Music is no longer determined by the gloves Phases. You can configure the volume in the settings.";
  22:"CHANGE|Changed it so that streaks with 25 or more kills have an occluded highlight, so when we add caves and stuff they aren't visible at all times.";
  23:"CHANGE|Officially rebranded the game to Killstreak Revelation.";
  24:"CHANGE|Updated the sign in the lobby to look better and to account for the new name.";
  25:"CHANGE|Updated all necesary UI elements to display the new name.";
  26:"FIXES|Fixed an issue where the sound section in settings said Visual Effects.";
  27:"FIXES|Fixed an issue where closing the variant GUI would result in a broken glove.";
  28:"FIXES|Fixed the mobile UI being completely broken on tablet, making the game nearly unplayable.";
  29:"FIXES|Fixed an issue where the mobile leave UI would say Killstreak Calamity v2 instead of Killstreak Revengeance.";
  30:"REMOVAL|Removed the spinning script in the KSRev logo in the lobby.";
  31:"REMOVAL|Removed Herobrine.";
endTbl;

